  "scope": "Unchanged ActivityManager, ActivityPlugin, CutscenePlugin and Cutscene.kt on JDK 11 with Kotlin 1.8.20 over the unchanged MapZone, RegionZone, ZoneRestriction, ZoneType, DynamicRegion, Region, RegionChunk, RegionManager and the MinimapState writer, with the real pinned cache regions, scenery definitions and XTEA keys of fixtures/dynamic-regions/cache.json. Original text inserted: the dynamic-regions markers, Location.transform(Direction), ContentAPI getAttribute/setAttribute/removeAttribute/openInterface/closeInterface, Player.getCutscene and getCutsceneStage. Recording adapters: Player and NPC members (attributes, properties, locks, walking queue, interface manager, packet dispatch, dialogue interpreter actions, logout listeners, event hooks, pulse manager), the multiway zone object, GameWorld (settings and a fixed-order pulser), ServerConstants, the ContentAPI dialogue functions, PlayerCamera, AntiMacro, the session and the zone monitor. Content activities, cutscene plugins and cutscenes are scripted oracle content (adapters.py TestActivity, TestCutscenePlugin, TestCutscene) calling only inherited original members. Every case runs in a class loader of its own; the k-th recorded call of a marked operation fails in the injected failure cases.",
